<title>
OBD System Description
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
When ignition is “ON” with no malfunction in A/T control system detected, transmission warning light (1) lights for about 2 seconds and then goes OFF for bulb check.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When TCM detects a malfunction in A/T control system, it indicates transmission warning light and stores DTC in its memory.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
It is possible to communicate with vehicle through DLC (2) using SUZUKI scan tool (3). Diagnostic information can be checked and cleared using SUZUKI scan tool.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A510001.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "142.402mm" ver = "01" gw = "220" gh = "387"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
For information about the following items, refer to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A1111003">OBD System Description:K14C</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
